244
00:16:41,220 --> 00:16:44,580
It's hope that. Something new
might happen with. You around.

245
00:16:45,570 --> 00:16:50,460
In more ways than one. The page
workshop. Is too earnest.

246
00:16:50,820 --> 00:16:53,298
Elliot, does it have
something to do with what

247
00:16:53,382 --> 00:16:55,770
Mr. Glenn said about
the first silver sugar?

248
00:16:56,400 --> 00:16:59,058
There's no way she'll succeed.
She only

249
00:16:59,142 --> 00:17:02,520
