Look in. There. It's him.

254
00:17:27,940 --> 00:17:29,230
I'm sorry.

255
00:17:29,470 --> 00:17:34,990
I never intended to make you suffer.
Just don't see her. Ever.

256
00:17:38,908 --> 00:17:39,802
Oh, show.

257
00:17:42,260 --> 00:17:45,848
And you seriously do
love that fairy,

258
00:17:45,962 --> 00:17:48,290
