279
00:18:55,780 --> 00:18:59,008
I see, but for artisans.
Just five.

280
00:18:59,092 --> 00:19:02,818
Yes, that's right. I think that should
be a pretty clear indication.

281
00:19:02,902 --> 00:19:05,368
We just don't have
enough artisans. So we're

