291
00:19:55,900 --> 00:19:59,300
Oh. You're right.
Wait just a moment.

292
00:20:02,290 --> 00:20:06,568
What happened? I heard
about the silver sugar, so I.

293
00:20:06,652 --> 00:20:10,480
