300
00:20:53,220 --> 00:20:55,728
You'll adjust to this.
It's fine, but.

301
00:20:55,812 --> 00:20:58,488
I don't want to adjust.
That's childish.

302
00:20:58,572 --> 00:21:02,160
If that's the only reason you're here,
then leave. That isn't all.

303
00:21:02,430 --> 00:21:05,160
The truth is,
I have to rescue you, shell.

304
00:21:05,790 --> 00:21:07,758
Or else I can never
say that I became

305
00:21:07,842 --> 00:21:10,170
