then I'll have earned the title
because of your strength.

308
00:21:16,992 --> 00:21:19,890
That's why I'll rely
on my own abilities.

309
00:21:20,010 --> 00:21:24,510
What I can do as a sugar
artisan to set you free shall

310
00:21:25,320 --> 00:21:28,158
