And someday I can proudly.

311
00:21:28,242 --> 00:21:33,140
Say I'm a silver sugar master.
My team.

312
00:21:35,380 --> 00:21:40,860
You're truly very stupid.
No, don't call me stupid.

313
00:21:42,450 --> 00:21:45,138
I made the mistake. If you say

314
00:21:45,222 --> 00:21:50,050
this is a matter of pride for
you. And I won't stop you. And.

315
00:21:52,390 --> 00:21:54,580
I've never
been rescued by anyone.

316
